PRODUCTION RUN HELP
Run the gateway in the foreground until Ctrl-C or a local control stop

Usage: llmgw run --config <PATH>

Options:
      --config <PATH>  Explicit path to the gateway TOML configuration
  -h, --help           Print help

BENCHMARK EXAMPLE HELP
Usage: bench_gateway --config <CONFIG> --policy <POLICY>

Options:
      --config <CONFIG>  
      --policy <POLICY>  [possible values: fifo, rr]
  -h, --help             Print help
